msgctxt "96"
msgid "Haha... I'm no match for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "108"
msgid "You truly are above me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Losing a fist fight doesn't make you any less of a man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Why don't you try getting some help from the HLA again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "The HLA, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Do you really think I could make a fresh start with them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"I can't make any promises, but if you still wanna make\r\n"
"good, it couldn't hurt to try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Yeah... I guess so. Might be worth a shot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Heh. You make me feel like I really can do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "I'll give it one more try..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Thanks for the push."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "What a pain..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "You must be Tetsuji, one of the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Wait, you're Kazuma Kiryu-san, aren't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Yeah, that's right. You know who I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Sure do! So what brings you down here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "I live in Okinawa now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "You don't say... What a small world, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Kiryu-san. Do you mind if I ask you something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Have things gone smoothly for you since you left the yakuza?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't say smoothly, but, yeah, it's been working out\r\n"
"all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"I see... I put in some time myself with a family directly\r\n"
"under the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "That's how I recognized you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "That makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"I wanted to get out pretty bad. I cut all ties and left\r\n"
"Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"But the flak I got for my criminal record from my yakuza\r\n"
"days was much harsher than I expected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Full-time work was out of the question. I couldn't\r\n"
"even get part-time jobs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"And even if I did manage to get hired, it was all over\r\n"
" as soon as word got around that I'd been in the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Yeah, I understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"When I couldn't make ends meet, I went to see my brothers in\r\n"
"the family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "They found me work as a hitman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "So that's why you're back with the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"But once I went back into the business, everybody treated\r\n"
"me like a coward who tried to run away from it all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Finally, I couldn't take it anymore. That's when I left and\r\n"
"came to join up with the Reapers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Anyway, what brings you to come see me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "The HLA sent me to pick you up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "The HLA, huh? Seems like an ancient memory now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"Look, I'm not seeking revenge against the yakuza or\r\n"
"anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"It's just that the Reapers were the only ones who helped\r\n"
"me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "They took me in when I had nowhere else to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "If they're against the HLA, then I have to side with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "So I'm sorry, but I can't go with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "You seem like a decent guy, so I hate to do this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "...but I'm prepared to use force if I have to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "So that's how it is, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "You quit and made good. I quit but couldn't get by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "Let's see which one of us comes out on top!"
msgstr ""

